          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360050216012-Understanding-campaign-schedule-and-send-options#h_01HE5MH4JTJ0YXHQW63EWH4HGP",
          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360050216012-Understanding-campaign-schedule-and-send-options#h_01HE5MH4JTBK7PRG2GYZK66Q13",
          "text": "Schedule vs. Send now"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/360050216012-Understanding-campaign-schedule-and-send-options#h_01HE5MH4JT97F44YG9WTG81FCT",
          "text": "Send strategies"
